ng branches buildable with current toolchains and CI as occasionally it makes sense to cherry-pick some commits.\r\n\r\nIn this case to cherry-pick #98855 and not get failing CI, the following changes were needed.\r\n\r\nMost are changes already made in 3.5+ and now cherry-picked to 3.4 too, with the exception of:\r\n\r\n- 6b202812ffe3a790357a643868afb6c058fdbaca which updates all GitHub Actions to their latest version.\r\n\r\n- 9e9ea714adcc319bde381e292efcca62fa2c7991 which removes a usage of `distutils.version.LooseVersion` which had been removed in 3.5+ by a much bigger refactoring (061c28087340f24d98174ce6088053121bd49e14).\r\nRecent Python completely removed `distutils`, and the alternative is to use the `packaging` library, which isn't part of the standard library and I didn't want to add a new dependency. So I just replaced it with a hack from https://stackoverflow.com/a/11887825, which isn't bullet proof but should be fine here.\r\n\r\nI'll cherry-pick those changes for earlier branches too with similar PRs.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":6559374,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjU1OTM3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/12","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/12","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/12/labels","number":12,"state":"closed","title":"3.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com